      "message": "What is meant to be fixed by this change?  BrightnessSynchronizer is very sensitive to the updates it needs to process and can have multiple brightness changes in process at the same time, so I\u0027m concerned about deleting all RUN_UPDATE messages, in particular in those instances with multiple updates.",
